k on ebay once for only 40 bucks. I say Only cuz I've seen them listed for over 70.00. Keep an eye out and you might find a bargain.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T14:10:47-08:00","id":20358,"title":"","content":"Added Kindred of the East and White Wolf Magazines to the list. Yeah, if anybody has quotes to songs and poems from the books I don't have, I'll be interested in seeing them (Which is mostly Vampire, Mage, and Demon).<br /> But like Hunter, I expect Demon to have very few quotes, if at all. As Revised and after Changeling's setting era books tended to only have quotes at the opening chapters. While 1st and 2nd edition books had quotes all over the place in a book.<br /> <br /> What I find funny is that a lot of the quoted music isn't &quot;Goth Music&quot;. While there are Goth songs/bands and 80's/90's songs/bands quoted, a majority of the music is what I would nostalgically call &quot;Dad's&quot; 60's/70's non-disco music. My dad would always bring his recorded cassette tapes with him when we went traveling anywhere when I was a kid. So I recognize <b>A LOT</b> of the singers/bands quoted from there.<br /> <br /> <b>@Darling Rose:</b> That's nothing. You need to check out how much Charnel Houses of Europe: The Shoah is going for on Amazon.com. It costs more than Dark Ages: Fae. It's probably the only Wraith book I could obtain pretty much via POD. Same with Changeling when it came to Kithbook: Pooka.<br /> I'll probably get the missing Wraith books by Dec. or January.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":". 11-29-2013, 05:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T02:29:30-08:00","id":20562,"title":"","content":"hehehe I managed to snag Charnel Houses off ebay for 18.00. I like some of Amazon's prices, but if you're buying all from the same seller, they charge you the same shipping for every single book even if they're just 2 dollars, you're paying more in shipping every time. At lea